CompanionCommand: {
	Description: Palico commands
	SinglePlayerOnly: Chat commands are single-player only. Use the Palico panel in multiplayer.
	PlanUsage: /palico plan right|left|down LENGTH — aim the cursor at the starting tile.
	Help:
		'''
		/palico summon / dismiss / follow / pause / recall / bag / give / takeall / pet / chest / store / supply / mine / place torch/platform/rope / plan right/left/down LENGTH / confirm / cancel / pickup / combat / torches / bridges / ropes
		Common actions are available in the Palico panel. Set shortcuts in Controls.
		'''
}

